# Frontend-design skill router

Before proposing or changing the visual system, layout, navigation, HTML, or CSS under `src/renderer/`, read `.agents/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` and follow it.

Keep AvaNevis local-first: visual work must not introduce cloud controls, telemetry, background upload, or account state unless the user separately authorizes that product work.
